## 🎓 Thesis & Dissertation Checklist

Before submitting a thesis or dissertation, researchers can review the following checklist:

- [ ] Research problem clearly defined
- [ ] Research objectives established
- [ ] Research questions aligned with objectives
- [ ] Literature review completed
- [ ] Research gap identified
- [ ] Appropriate methodology selected
- [ ] Sampling procedure documented
- [ ] Data collection procedure explained
- [ ] Ethical considerations addressed
- [ ] Data analyzed appropriately
- [ ] Results presented clearly
- [ ] Findings discussed
- [ ] Research limitations documented
- [ ] Conclusions supported by findings
- [ ] References checked
- [ ] Tables and figures reviewed
- [ ] Formatting requirements reviewed
- [ ] Grammar and consistency checked

